# The OEM camera provider requires the separately-declared Qualcomm module
# daemon before it probes camera IDs.  The OEM service remains disabled by
# default and its original start trigger lives below vendor/etc/init/hw; start
# it from a top-level device rc as well so every Android 16 product layout
# (LineageOS, Evolution X, and crDroid) has the same bring-up ordering.
#
# start is idempotent: if the vendor trigger already started qcamerasvr, init
# keeps that existing service instance.
on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data/vendor/camera 0770 camera camera
    start qcamerasvr
